|GKB============================= Ventriloquism ==============================
|GKB=|XX0   Syntax: [cvent]riloquism |YKB<target>|XX0                                    |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0                                                                        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   This ability allows you to throw your voice, making it appear        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   that <target> is calling their companions horrible names, and        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   taunting them. The companion might just turn away, or might          |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   turn on the attacker and attack.                                     |GKB=
|GKB==========================================================================
